        <mxCell id="tech_notes_content" value="Frontend: React.js/Vue.js, Material-UI, Google Maps JavaScript API, Redux/Vuex&#xa;Backend: Python 3.8+, Flask/FastAPI, JWT Auth, Celery, Redis&#xa;Algorithms: scikit-learn (K-means), DEAP (Genetic Algorithm), pandas, numpy, geopy&#xa;Database: MySQL 8.0+, Redis Cache, S3/GCS File Storage&#xa;APIs: Google Places, Google Reviews, Distance Matrix, Google Maps&#xa;Infrastructure: Nginx, Gunicorn, Docker, Monitoring (Prometheus/Sentry)&#xa;Deployment: VPS, PaaS (Heroku), Docker+K8s, or Serverless (AWS Lambda)&#xa;&#xa;Cost Estimate: $20-500/month depending on traffic&#xa;Development Time: 12-14 weeks for full implementation" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
